    "description": "Rueblur is one of the most interactive social media platforms in the world. Rueblur gives users a new way to interact with content utilizing the rate and react system. Rueblur provides users control of their experience by embracing the mantra \u201cWhere liberation meets inspiration\u201d meaning users have creative control of their Rueblur experience. Users can tailor their interest the way they want by crafting feeds and content specific list with various topics. Rueblur feeds can be created and modified at any time.\r\n\r\nRueblur aims to make social media fun again! Rate, react, share, and interact with users and content everywhere. Create exclusive Rueblur content and accounts to distribute fun videos, polls, captures, and content to your followers. Use Rueblur rank to see the most popular accounts and content in the world, and last but not least create Rueblur business accounts to connect and promote business and professional endeavors!",
